DEOCCURS DS    11CL79                                                   00008800
DELENGTH EQU   *-DEDATELM      LENGTH OF THE RECORD                     00009000
DEFXRECL EQU   DEDESLIN-DEDATELM   LENGTH OF THE FIXED PORTION          00010004
DEVBRECL EQU   L'DEDESLIN          LENGTH OF THE VARIABLE PORTION       00020004
DENOVARS EQU   ((DELENGTH-DEFXRECL)/DEVBRECL)  MAX NUM OF OCCURS        00030004
